{"query": {"id": "20260628155832817267_706fa9f1", "handle": "q2", "text": "“Ring
of Nestor” gold ring Mycenaean archaeology discovery details", "importance": 
"core"}, "items": [{"id": "20260628160117652896_5571131c", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "Evans 在《The ring of 
Nestor》一书中描述，这枚金质印章戒指与一批金质印章戒指和珠状印章被报告从博奥提亚
Thisbê 附近的一处墓葬环境出土，随后通过当地发现者或中间商进入艺术与古物市场。", 
"source_ids": ["20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations": [14]}, {"id": 
"20260628160117714650_c802043c", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Evans 
说明他是在市场上购得“Ring of 
Nestor”，并在书中叙述了从据称的提斯贝墓葬到其收藏的传承路径，将戒指纳入自己对米
诺斯宗教和葬礼信仰的研究体系。", "source_ids": 
["20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations": [14]}, {"id": 
"20260628160117774965_662d5304", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Evans 将“Ring of 
Nestor”描述为“a large oval gold 
signet-ring”并配有图像板，显示其印面雕刻多个人物、动物和其他符号，与克里特米诺斯
印章艺术相比较。", "source_ids": ["20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations":
[14]}, {"id": "20260628160117835978_5957f87a", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"在同一著作中，Evans 依据风格比较，将“Ring of 
Nestor”归入米诺斯或“米诺斯化”作品，并将其年代放在晚期米诺斯或与迈锡尼时期对应的
时间层位。", "source_ids": ["20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations": 
[14]}, {"id": "20260628160117897631_fc32d919", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"Cambridge 平台的 Journal of Hellenic Studies 条目指出，Arthur J. Evans 
的文章“The Ring of Nestor: A Glimpse into the Minoan After-World and A 
Sepulchral Treasure of Gold Signet-Rings and Bead-Seals from Thisbê, 
Boeotia”收录在该期刊中，是对来自 Thisbê 墓葬金质印章戒指与珠状印章以及“Ring of 
Nestor”的学术讨论。", "source_ids": ["20260628155959461566_821c904a"], 
"citations": [8]}, {"id": "20260628160117960331_6d88656e", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "Cambridge 条目表明，这篇文章围绕一批被归属于 Thisbê 
的墓葬金印章戒指和珠状印章，重点讨论“Ring of 
Nestor”的出土地、收藏途径以及图像与风格的米诺斯归属问题。", "source_ids": 
["20260628155959461566_821c904a"], "citations": [8]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118031294_e03cb3a0", "type": "Evidence", "text": "SciSpace 
条目列出该文献题名为“The ring of Nestor: a glimpse into the Minoan after-world 
and a sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, 
Boeotia”，作者为 Arthur J. Evans，并给出一个类似 DOI 的标识号，将出版时间标记为 
1925。", "source_ids": ["20260628160115870251_b95f028a"], "citations": [15]}, 
{"id": "20260628160118096444_f5deb480", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Met Museum 
的文章提到，Émile Gilliéron 及其子制作了包括“Ring of Minos”和“Ring of 
Nestor”在内的金质印章戒指复制品和绘图，这些作品在 20 
世纪早期通过出版物和展览广泛传播。", "source_ids": 
["20260628160115906443_1a972180"], "citations": [16]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118160967_ecace54b", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Met Museum 
文中指出，这些包括“Ring of 
Nestor”在内的复制品不仅为学界提供参考图像，也因其在某些情况下基于修复性重绘而引
发关于真实性和潜在伪造的讨论。", "source_ids": 
["20260628160115906443_1a972180"], "citations": [16]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118223444_66686e64", "type": "Evidence", "text": "The Past 
的文章在介绍普洛斯“Griffin 
Warrior”墓中四枚大型金质印章戒指时，提到另一著名金戒指“Ring of Nestor”由 Arthur 
Evans 
所购，被用来比较这些新出土戒指的图像与风格，并强调两者都属于晚期青铜时代迈锡尼精
英文化的代表性例子。", "source_ids": ["20260628160115941785_5ddfed8d"], 
"citations": [17]}, {"id": "20260628160118288935_465dc346", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "JSTOR 摘要引用短语“THE RING OF NESTOR (EVANS, PM. IV, FIG. 915b) fell 
into disuse in ...”，表明作者在讨论圣路易斯市艺术博物馆印章戒指时，将“Ring of 
Nestor”作为 Evans《The Palace of 
Minos》中的标志性实例，但指出该戒指在某一时期不再被作为标准例证使用。", 
"source_ids": ["20260628160115973775_cf2d4edd"], "citations": [18]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118350088_285fdfdc", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"该文章通过比较圣路易斯印章戒指与 Mycenaean 金戒指及 Ionic 
戒指的雕刻深度与风格，提及“Ring of Nestor”作为其中一件 Mycenaean 
金戒指的代表，来讨论不同传统之间的差异和可能的伪造或再利用问题。", "source_ids":
["20260628160115973775_cf2d4edd"], "citations": [18]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118413852_47ddb2f5", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Academia.edu 
上的论文摘要说明，该研究“focuses on the iconography of the ‘Ring of 
Nestor’”并将其纳入爱琴伪造与真实性争论的背景，指出通过人物、动物和场景构图的分析
来评估它是否符合特定历史阶段的爱琴艺术语言。", "source_ids": 
["20260628155934886510_6c8b75ae"], "citations": [2]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118484585_99df791c", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"摘要提到，作者回顾了过去关于“Ring of 
Nestor”真实性的不同意见，一些学者认为它是正品，而另一些则指出其风格混杂和发现过
程中的疑点，可能表明其为一个晚期伪造或受 Gilliéron 等人影响的作品。", 
"source_ids": ["20260628155934886510_6c8b75ae"], "citations": [2]}, {"id": 
"20260628160118547872_eefad71e", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"该论文还指出，作者通过整理“Ring of 
Nestor”的物理特征、尺寸和工艺特点，与确证为米诺斯或迈锡尼时期的金印章戒指进行比
对，以提出对其年代和文化归属的新评估。", "source_ids": 
["20260628155934886510_6c8b75ae"], "citations": [2]}, {"id": 
"20260628160141368899_bc7f953c", "type": "Claim", "text": "Arthur J. Evans’s 
1925 study titled \"The ring of Nestor: a glimpse into the Minoan after-world 
and a sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, 
Boeotia,\" published in the Journal of Hellenic Studies, is the first systematic
academic publication on the Ring of Nestor and the associated gold signet rings 
and bead seals from the reported tomb near Thisbê in Boeotia.", "source_ids": 
["20260628155959461566_821c904a", "20260628160115870251_b95f028a"], "citations":
[8, 15]}, {"id": "20260628160141505692_642d3c37", "type": "Claim", "text": 
"Arthur J. Evans obtained the Ring of Nestor by purchase on the art and 
antiquities market; according to his own account, the ring and a group of gold 
signet rings and bead seals were reported to have been discovered in a tomb 
context near Thisbê in Boeotia before entering the market.", "source_ids": 
["20260628155959461566_821c904a", "20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations":
[8, 14]}, {"id": "20260628160141650849_3e5c37e7", "type": "Claim", "text": "In 
his publications on the Ring of Nestor, Arthur J. Evans describes the object as 
a large oval gold signet ring with a complex engraved bezel showing multiple 
human figures, animals, and symbols, and he reproduces the imagery in plates 
that compare the ring to Cretan Minoan seal art.", "source_ids": 
["20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations": [14]}, {"id": 
"20260628160141733369_275368f5", "type": "Claim", "text": "Evans interprets the 
Ring of Nestor’s imagery as important evidence for Minoan religious beliefs and 
conceptions of the afterlife, assigning the ring to a Minoan or \"Minoanized\" 
artistic tradition and dating it stylistically to a Late Minoan phase 
corresponding to the Mycenaean period.", "source_ids": 
["20260628160115817101_d43ec8ee"], "citations": [14]}, {"id": 
"20260628160141817612_3c20318b", "type": "Claim", "text": "Later scholarship has
re-examined the Ring of Nestor’s iconography, physical characteristics, and 
reported discovery story, with some authors arguing that stylistic mixture and 
suspicious aspects of its market trajectory may indicate a late forgery or a 
work influenced by early-20th-century restorers such as Émile Gilliéron, while 
others still treat it as a genuine Minoan or Mycenaean-period artifact.", 
"source_ids": ["20260628155934886510_6c8b75ae", "20260628160115906443_1a972180",
"20260628160115941785_5ddfed8d"], "citations": [2, 16, 17]}, {"id": 
"20260628160142013524_5b519898", "type": "Claim", "text": "Émile Gilliéron and 
his son produced drawings and replicas of the Ring of Nestor (along with the 
Ring of Minos and other Bronze Age objects), and these reproductions circulated 
widely in early 20th-century publications and exhibitions, influencing both 
scholarly and public perceptions of Greek Bronze Age material culture and 
contributing to later concerns about restoration practices, authenticity, and 
potential forgery.", "source_ids": ["20260628160115906443_1a972180"], 
"citations": [16]}, {"id": "20260628160142115938_9d0dbb49", "type": "Claim", 
"text": "The Ring of Nestor has been used as a comparative Mycenaean gold signet
ring in later studies, including analyses of the St. Louis Art Museum seal ring 
and discussions of the Griffin Warrior tomb rings, but some modern authors note 
that Evans’s \"Ring of Nestor\" example, as reproduced in The Palace of Minos 
(vol. IV, fig. 915b), subsequently \"fell into disuse\" as a standard reference 
in scholarly discourse.", "source_ids": ["20260628160115941785_5ddfed8d", 
"20260628160115973775_cf2d4edd"], "citations": [17, 18]}], "offset": 0, "limit":
50, "total": 22, "next_offset": null}
