figures, altars or cult tables, vegetal and landscape motifs, and animal 
symbols, and use these parallels to place the Ring of Nestor within the same 
Late Bronze Age Minoanizing Mycenaean milieu as the Griffin Warrior rings.", 
"source_ids": ["20260628161341139606_0ff54332"], "citations": [30]}, {"id": 
"20260628161410150222_00d9a760", "type": "Claim", "text": "Based on the newly 
