Late Bronze Age ring participating in the same Minoanizing Mycenaean koine and 
contend that a modern forger is unlikely to have anticipated these complex, 
later‑discovered iconographic structures.", "source_ids": 
["20260628161341139606_0ff54332"], "citations": [30]}, {"id": 
"20260628161410310253_6e57d392", "type": "Claim", "text": "A technical study of 
the Ring of Nestor, as summarized in a ResearchGate entry, reports new technical
observations and states that these support the ring’s authenticity; the snippet 
