Stocker’s view that the Griffin Warrior rings’ Minoan‑style imagery demonstrates
close cultural connections and interaction between Minoan Crete and Mycenaean 
mainland elites and note that these finds have reshaped scholarly discussion of 
Minoan–Mycenaean relations.", "source_ids": ["20260628161341192361_fb6076c8", 
"20260628161341219086_0896ad6b"], "citations": [31, 32]}, {"id": 
