https://www.academia.edu/83658257/SOME_OBSERVATIONS_ON_THE_ICONOGRAPHY_OF_THE_RI
NG_OF_NESTOR_', 'source_ids': ['20260628155934886510_6c8b75ae'], 'kind': 
'paragraph'}, {'text': '3. J. Bennet, "Minoan Glyptic," in J. Bennet (ed.), *The
Art and Archaeology of the Aegean Bronze Age* (Cambridge University Press). 
https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/art-and-archaeology-of-the-aegean-bronze-ag
e/minoan-glyptic/6AC643B9B2C1218FD1549988757EF168', 'source_ids': 
['20260628155934917200_3d0c0067'], 'kind': 'paragraph'}, {'text': '4. American 
