Minoan Gems in the ..." *Journal of Hellenic Studies* 75 (1955). 
https://www.jstor.org/stable/3047959', 'source_ids': 
['20260628155935012000_d8fb8c0c'], 'kind': 'paragraph'}, {'text': '7. Nestor 
